---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Methodology & Advisory Services | Saram Consulting"
  description="About the QMS Vendor Landscape research initiative, verification methodology, sources, and Saram Consulting GxP advisory."
  activePath="/about"
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero-text">
      <h1>Research Methodology & About Saram</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Independent GxP & AI Market Intelligence for the Life Sciences</p>
      <p>
        The QMS Vendor Landscape is an open industry research initiative conducted by <strong>Saram Consulting</strong>. Our objective is to cut through vendor marketing jargon, deliver verifiable architectural truth, and provide life sciences leaders with clear decision models.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Methodology & Sources -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">Research Methodology & Knowledge Bank Citations</h2>
      <div class="callout-box">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Durable Reference Sources</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          This intelligence repository is grounded in continuous empirical research synthesized from the <strong>qms-vendor-landscape.md durable reference</strong> (session 2026-06-02 + delta update 2026-06-13).
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <li>
            <strong>SEC & Corporate Filings:</strong> Financial disclosures, ARR metrics ($200M ARR for MasterControl), and M&A transactions (Honeywell acq. ETQ Sept 2021; PTC acq. Arena 2021; MasterControl acq. Qualer March 2025).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Regulatory & Standards Bodies:</strong> ISO/IEC 42001 certification records (MasterControl July 2025; Greenlight Guru June 2026), FDA QMSR harmonization updates, and FDA CSA final guidance.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Product Releases & Protocol Audits:</strong> Verified GA announcements including Veeva Vault AI Agents (Dec 2025) and Veeva Vault Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server (release 26R2, Aug 2026); Dot Compliance Dottie AI Gen 5.0 (Apr 2026).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Customer Deployment Verifications:</strong> Practical shortlist assignments reflect live production customer footprints across commercial biopharma, medical device manufacturers, and CDMOs.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div style="font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted-text);">
          No vendor pays to be listed or ranked in this research. All tier assignments and buyer segment recommendations are strictly editorially independent.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Saram Consulting -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">About Saram Consulting</h2>
      <p>
        Saram Consulting bridges the gap between modern artificial intelligence and rigorous regulatory standards. We help life science, biotechnology, and MedTech companies safely integrate AI into their operational workflows while maintaining uncompromised GxP compliance and daily IT support.
      </p>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 16px 0;">
        <div style="background: var(--card-bg); padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border);">
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px;">Equity-Based AI Partnerships</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #333; line-height: 1.55;">
            For select high-impact projects, we build custom, production-grade AI and compliance applications with zero upfront engineering fees in exchange for equity and/or profit-sharing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--card-bg); padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border);">
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px;">GxP AI Agent Framework</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #333; line-height: 1.55;">
            Our enterprise multi-agent architecture unites 15 specialized Pydantic AI agents, 3-Store Hybrid GraphRAG, zero-trust EvidenceGate verification, and 21 CFR Part 11 append-only audit trails.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--card-bg); padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border);">
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px;">Validation & CSA Transition</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #333; line-height: 1.55;">
            We guide quality organizations from cumbersome legacy CSV documentation matrices to modern, risk-based Computer Software Assurance (CSA) methodologies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Details -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">Contact & Engagement</h2>
      <p>
        To propose a vendor update, request an objective QMS evaluation benchmark, or discuss an enterprise AI validation partnership:
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
        Email: <a href="mailto:info@saram.consulting" class="service-link">info@saram.consulting</a><br />
        Phone: <a href="tel:+19253946606" class="service-link">925-394-6606</a><br />
        Consulting Hub: <a href="https://saram.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="service-link">saram.io &rarr;</a><br />
        Flagship AI Product: <a href="https://gxpchat.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="service-link">GxPChat &rarr;</a><br />
        CSV/CSA Sister Site: <a href="https://csv.saram.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="service-link">csv.saram.io &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
